**.\n\nSelect $\\det(B^T)=-8$, $\\det(B^T)-\\det(I)=-9$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186704210 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32b632a3-5ba7-5b4d-b041-1c8ebbeea7bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704176} {:answer/id #uuid "9572ca87-21be-5eb0-8819-e28ef616ff3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704197}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9572ca87-21be-5eb0-8819-e28ef616ff3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704197} :answer-field/id #uuid "097f47ba-5967-555b-9fa7-540c9b2ba431" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704170} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "568fbd50-6845-59ae-8c59-32754cf89f21" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704185} {:answer/id #uuid "9c64454c-fa2c-5fbf-9d8e-0a70cc714d47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704199}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9c64454c-fa2c-5fbf-9d8e-0a70cc714d47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704199} :answer-field/id #uuid "34ff3809-bb23-5ae0-b524-422cf386cf90" :answer-field/key "$\\det(I)=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704177} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b9d3f45-0100-5be9-9f25-5448343942f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704188} {:answer/id #uuid "c7b2bea8-b35a-5343-8287-623bd1bec84d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704205}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c7b2bea8-b35a-5343-8287-623bd1bec84d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704205} :answer-field/id #uuid "83a77022-87c6-5397-af6b-e82d77e2121f" :answer-field/key "$\\det(B^T)-\\det(I)=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704193} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f68c482-e423-5eeb-bef3-672f502f4121" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704181} {:answer/id #uuid "69dd1a9b-4926-5e19-9558-a7f54a698be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704189}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "69dd1a9b-4926-5e19-9558-a7f54a698be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704189} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec946599-232d-5eef-bef2-dd56ec29d925" :answer-field/key "$\\det(B^T)=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186704209}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "eeb72bd1-a741-5b28-9e0d-0b1bdb3aa074" :question/problem "Let $B$ be a square matrix with $\\det(B)=0$, and let $I$ be the identity matrix of the same size.\n\nRecall that transposing a matrix leaves its determinant unchanged and that $\\det(I)=1$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Transposition preserves the determinant, and the identity matrix has determinant $1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\det(B^T)&=\\det(B)=0 \\\\ \\det(I)&=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $\\det(B^T)=0$,\n\n$$\n\\det(B^T)=(0)=0.\n$$\n\nThis statement is **true**.\n\nFor $\\det(I)=0$,\n\n$$\n\\det(I)=(1)=1\\ne 0.\n$$\n\nThis statement is **false**.\n\nFor $\\det(B^T)-\\det(I)=1$,\n\n$$\n\\det(B^T)-\\det(I)=(0)-(1)=-1\\ne 1.\n$$\n\nThis statement is **false**.\n\nSelect $\\det(B^T)=0$. **None of the above** is false."}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating an Expression Involving Given Determinants and Matrix Types"}]}
